deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nNot reproducible in 4.3.stable\nReproducible in v4.4.beta.custom_build [1586c5674]\n\nI will try to bisect the issue later, but I think this is at least 2 weeks old now.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta (1586c5674) - Manjaro Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 05 Dec 2024 16:26:44 +0000 on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Single-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 7900 XT (RADV NAVI31) - AMD Ryzen 9 7900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn the Wayland version of the editor, there is a regression whereby typing using the numpad does not work properly anymore. It appears that everything will work the first time Godot is launched in the Wayland session, then after some time (probably simply alt-tabbing out and back in), numpad behaves as if it was off (typing numbers becomes impossible and the cursor is moved instead). This behavior is exclusive to Godot, the numpad works properly everywhere else in the session.\nIn Godot 4.3, there is no such issue, it appeared sometime around 4.4 beta 1 or maybe a bit earlier, I will try to bisect the exact commit.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOn a Wayland session, and with the Wayland version of the editor (Run/Platforms/Prefer Wayland on - no issue on X11 version), alt-tab out and back in the editor. Numpad should not be detected properly anymore, even after completely closing the editor (and even the terminal that launched it) and opening it again.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102259/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102259/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}